"  -e, --engine=ENGINE  :  Use specified backup engine.\n"
"              Valid engines are tar, tar.gz, tar.bz2 and rsync.\n"
"  -x, --exclude='PATTERN'  :  Skip files matching PATTERN.\n"
"  -n, --nice=NICE  :  Indicate the niceness of the backup process (-20 to "
